---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Montana Backcountry Gear Checklist — Spiked Adrenaline"
  description="The free gear checklist we actually pack for Montana backcountry hunts and backpacking trips. Field-proven, no filler."
>
  <section class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Free download</p>
    <h1>The Montana Backcountry Gear Checklist</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The exact day-pack list we check before every pack-in — weather, med kit, kill kit,
      and the pieces that save a trip or a life. Every item earned its spot on a real trip,
      usually the hard way.
    </p>
    <ul class="bullets">
      <li>The one tool that never goes in the pack — it stays <em>on your body</em>, always</li>
      <li>A six-item med kit where one wool sock does a job that could save your life</li>
      <li>The full kill kit — including why it's a contractor bag and razor blades, not kitchen bags and a spare knife</li>
      <li>Why fire shows up on the list <em>twice</em>, in two different pockets</li>
      <li>The rain cover almost every bowhunter forgets (it's not the one on your pack)</li>
      <li>The pattern behind it all: weight only goes to gear that does two jobs or saves your life</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="panel capture">
      <h2>Get the checklist</h2>
      <p class="muted">Drop your email and we'll send it over. You'll also get new field tests as they publish. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
      <form action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST" class="cta-form">
        <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="e79534b4-1ab2-4688-b630-6ef3aa6960cd" />
        <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New signup — Montana Backcountry Gear Checklist" />
        <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="Spiked Adrenaline" />
        <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="https://spikedadrenaline.com/thanks/" />
        <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" class="hidden" style="display:none;" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required aria-label="Email address" />
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Send me the checklist</button>
      </form>
      <!-- TODO: attach/deliver the actual checklist PDF or page once drafted -->
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  section { margin-top: 3rem; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 6vw, 2.6rem); margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .bullets { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .bullets li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .capture { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .capture h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  .cta-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  @media (min-width: 540px) {
    .cta-form { flex-direction: row; }
    .cta-form input[type='email'] { flex: 1; }
  }
</style>
